00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:45.767 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Loin d'être convaincus

00:01:43.034 --> 00:01:47.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les députés de l'opposition

00:01:44.467 --> 00:01:48.634 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ont désavoué tour à tour

00:01:45.867 --> 00:01:50.067 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le grand patron de Hockey

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:51.467 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Canada.

00:01:48.734 --> 00:01:52.934 size:53% position:73% line:53%
PETER JULIAN, député, NPD

00:01:50.167 --> 00:01:54.367 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ça prend un nouveau leadership

00:01:51.567 --> 00:01:55.800 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour vraiment faire face

00:01:53.034 --> 00:01:57.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à cet échec total.

00:01:54.467 --> 00:01:58.634 size:53% position:73% line:53%
RICHARD MARTEL, député,

00:01:55.900 --> 00:02:00.067 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Parti conservateur du Canada

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:01.467 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Il est clair pour moi

00:01:58.734 --> 00:02:02.900 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que l'organisation a besoin

00:02:00.167 --> 00:02:04.334 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de redorer son blason et

00:02:01.567 --> 00:02:05.734 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de faire un grand ménage.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:07.167 size:53% position:73% line:53%
SÉBASTIEN LEMIRE, député, BQ

00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:08.600 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour pouvoir mener à bien

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:10.000 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les changemes s profonds

00:02:07.267 --> 00:02:11.434 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qu'on à faire dans l'ensemble de

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:12.834 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la structure de Hockey Canada.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:14.100 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Déçue du témoignage,

00:02:11.534 --> 00:02:15.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la ministre fédérale des Sport

00:02:12.934 --> 00:02:16.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
exige aussi des changements

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:17.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à la tête de Hockey Canada.

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:18.334 size:53% position:73% line:53%
PASCALE ST-ONGE, ministre

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:19.467 size:53% position:73% line:53%
fédérale des Sports

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:20.600 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Malgré la sincérité de

00:02:18.434 --> 00:02:21.767 size:53% position:73% line:53%
M. Smith, il semble y avoir

00:02:19.567 --> 00:02:22.934 size:53% position:73% line:53%
