00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:24.067 size:53% position:73% line:53%
reconnaître les problèmes

00:02:21.867 --> 00:02:25.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
systémiques au sein

00:02:23.034 --> 00:02:26.334 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de Hockey Canada.

00:02:24.167 --> 00:02:27.500 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le grand patron de Hockey

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:28.634 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Canada n'a pas voulu prononcer

00:02:26.434 --> 00:02:29.767 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les mots crise et problèmes

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:30.900 size:53% position:73% line:53%
systémiques lors de

00:02:28.734 --> 00:02:32.034 size:53% position:73% line:53%
son témoignage. Pas d'engagement

00:02:29.867 --> 00:02:34.934 size:53% position:73% line:53%
